21-04-27T16:28:54Z","body":"Ok, if i add aiProcess_PreTransformVertices:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1734117/116276856-9790ab00-a78d-11eb-9e49-78a2dedb73c6.png)\r\n(and it's also laying on the side...)\r\nAnd with the change undone:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1734117/116277891-98760c80-a78e-11eb-845f-fa33b81a6553.png)\r\n(also on the side, but this seems to be *alright*)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/827743285/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Garux","id":1734117,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzQxMTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1734117?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux","html_url":"https://github.com/Garux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Garux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/comments/827888777","html_url":"https://github.com/assimp/assimp/issues/3802#issuecomment-827888777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/assimp/assimp/issues/3802","id":827888777,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgyNzg4ODc3Nw==","user":{"login":"krishty","id":51880096,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxODgwMDk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51880096?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty","html_url":"https://github.com/krishty","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krishty/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-27T19:58:00Z","updated_at":"2021-04-27T19:58:00Z","body":"Thanks a lot for the testing! 👍 \r\n\r\nDo I understand correctly:\r\n\r\n1. change on, PreTransformVertices on: **wrong** (your 2nd pic)\r\n2. change on, PreTransformVertices off: **OK** (1st pic, small)\r\n3. change undone, PreTransformVertices on: **OK** (your 3rd pic)\r\n4. change undone, PreTransformVertices off: **wrong** (1st pic, large)\r\n\r\nDid you export the 3ds from Assimp to Blender? In this case keep in mind that the exporter may be broken, because “fixing” it is what broke the import int he first place.\r\n\r\nI think the source code of the Blender 3ds plugin can be found at https://github.com/blender/blender-addons-contrib/blob/master/io_scene_3ds/import_3ds.py#L831 and line 831 is the matrix we’re talking about. They’re building it from elements 0–3, 3–6, 6–9, and 9–12. Before the change, Assimp did the same; after it, it’s 0–3, 10, 3–6, 11, 6–9, 12. This can’t be right.\r\n\r\nI’ll submit a pull request to revert that. Someone needs to work out the black magic that makes the exporter work differently, though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","rea